{
  "title": "Quenched Resinous Tunisian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A traditional Tunisian dish featuring lamb, English mustard, and a mirepoix base, served with a resinous and shattering crust, perfect for a hangover cure. This Whole30-friendly recipe is cooked in a tava griddle.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
